{"version":1,"content":"<p>【15：50更新】今日（27日）上午10時許，筲箕灣道318號對開西行線路政署地盤有地底水管爆裂，大量水夾雜沙泥噴出，水花一度射上半空，黃泥水淹蓋行人路及來回行車線，途人及車輛須涉水而行。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:14.169387+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:50:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:18.232728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:20.166280+00:00","content_hash":"8c8a676f5a3b9893c96a4a1bc950ef08dd27e2c5c64c6c242d0370f840e9ab70","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}